    <description
  >The Site object represents a physical location managed in the PMS: a building, hotel, project location, office or clinic. It captures Module, Site Type, Status, address, Geolocation, Time Zone and check-in times, owned by an owner Account. Commonly used for portfolio management, hotel operations and branch scheduling.</description>
